       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks like an error.\n\n- **Requested:** ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Limits:** The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. Single doses are usually capped at 800 mg. This order is twice the daily maximum, and each dose is twice the usual single-dose limit.\n- **Risks:** At this dose the patient would face a high risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), a common regimen for inflammatory conditions.\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum.\n- **400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours** (1,600\u20132,400 mg/day), for analgesia.\n- **1600 mg/day total**, if that was the intended daily amount. It could be given as 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me which regimen you want, or confirm that you really want 1600 mg four times daily. I'll enter the order once I have that. I can also add a note, such as \"take with food\"."
      }
